tariffs","r":"management","s":"Adam Taich","x":"As Serge mentioned, APAC benefited from a temporary pull forward in purchasing activity in China, as customers accelerated orders ahead of potential tariff changes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/11/10x-genomics-txg-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TXG 2025 Q2","e":"txg","d":"2025-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Serge Saxonov","x":"Built to dramatically increase throughput and streamline workflows, Flex v2 provides ultimate flexibility for customers when designing their experiments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/11/10x-genomics-txg-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TXG 2025 Q3","e":"txg","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Serge Saxonov","x":"As a first-of-its-kind capability, Xenium protein represents a major leap forward, enabling comprehensive, multimodal insights, streamlining workflows and accelerating translational discovery.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/10x-genomics-txg-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TXG 2026 Q1","e":"txg","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Adam Taich","x":"A year ago on our Q1 call, we were operating in a highly uncertain macro environment after drastic changes to government research funding that led us to withdraw our full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/10x-genomics-txg-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TXG 2026 Q1","e":"txg","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Adam Taich","x":"Turning to our outlook for the rest of the year, we are maintaining our full-year outlook and expect 2026 revenue to be in the range of $600 million to $625 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/10x-genomics-txg-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TXG 2026 Q2","e":"txg","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Serge Saxonov","x":"A similar shift is also starting to happen biopharma with a rapid growth in AI-focused investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/14/10x-genomics-txg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TXG 2026 Q2","e":"txg","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Serge Saxonov","x":"The middle part is chemistry, where a lot of current AI sort of investment up to now have been focused.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/14/10x-genomics-txg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TXG 2026 Q2","e":"txg","d":"2026-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Adam Taich","x":"As anticipated, the decline in spatial instruments reflects customers moderating purchases of our current spatial products in anticipation of a tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/14/10x-genomics-txg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TXG 2026 Q2","e":"txg","d":"2026-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Adam Taich","x":"As a reminder, APAC benefited from approximately $4 million of temporary pull forward in purchasing activity in China in the prior year period as customers accelerated orders ahead of potential tariff changes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/14/10x-genomics-txg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TXG 2026 Q2","e":"txg","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Serge Saxonov","x":"Commercially, if you remember two years ago now, almost two years ago now, we did a major restructuring of our sales force, and we specifically created a team focused on CapEx sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/14/10x-genomics-txg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TXG 2026 Q2","e":"txg","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Adam Taich","x":"We are raising our full year outlook and now expect 2026 revenue to be in the range of $610 million-$630 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-t